{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_146_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_146","textTraditional":"一、十有四年，春王正月，莒子朱卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_146_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_146","textTraditional":"二、夏，衞孫林父自晉歸于衞。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_146_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_146","textTraditional":"三、秋，叔孫僑如如齊逆女。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_146_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_146","textTraditional":"四、鄭公子喜率師伐許。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_146_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_146","textTraditional":"五、九月，僑如以夫人婦姜氏至自齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_146_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_146","textTraditional":"六、冬十月庚寅，衞侯臧卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_146_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_146","textTraditional":"七、秦伯卒。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}